# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# THE PRIVATE JOURNAL IS NOT PUBLISHED.
#
# data/forecasts/ holds full forecast records: the question, the probability,
# the market price and the reasoning. Publishing those while a market is open
# hands a reader the live position, which is exactly what the commit-reveal
# scheme exists to prevent.
#
# What IS published lives in public/: the commitment chain (digest + timestamp,
# written at forecast time) and reveals (full records, written after the market
# resolves). See README.md.
#
# The private journal is therefore local-only and needs its own backup. Losing
# it does not invalidate the published commitments, but it does make every
# sealed forecast permanently unrevealable. Back it up somewhere private.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
data/forecasts/
data/resolutions/

# Secrets. No venue API key that can move money exists here until the live gate,
# and never in a tracked file even then.
.env
.env.*
!.env.example
*.key
*.pem
secrets/

# Regenerable market-price cache. The price that matters is the one embedded in
# each forecast record at the moment it was made, not this.
data/prices/

# Python
__pycache__/
*.pyc
.venv/
venv/
.pytest_cache/
.mypy_cache/

# OS / editor
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
.vscode/
.idea/
